    "呼号、APRS 消息和远控命令会经过 APRS-IS 公网传输，不应被视为私密或端到端加密通信。远控凭据原文只保存在本机，不会随命令发送。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Callsigns, APRS messages, and remote control commands are transmitted over the APRS-IS public network and should not be considered private or end-to-end encrypted communications. The original text of the remote control credentials is only saved locally and will not be sent with the command."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "呼号、APRS 消息和远控命令会经过 APRS-IS 公网传输，不应被视为私密或端到端加密通信。远控凭据原文只保存在本机，不会随命令发送。"
          }
        }
      }
