    "横屏仪表盘位于前台时，App 会从你选择的 FMO 接收音频并在本机生成波形；声音默认关闭。音频不录制、不保存、不上传，也不用于识别讲话者。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When the landscape dashboard is in the foreground, the app receives audio from the FMO of your choice and generates waveforms locally; sound is off by default. The audio is not recorded, saved, uploaded, or used to identify the speaker."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "横屏仪表盘位于前台时，App 会从你选择的 FMO 接收音频并在本机生成波形；声音默认关闭。音频不录制、不保存、不上传，也不用于识别讲话者。"
