    "每一步均为独立可达性检查；全部通过表示设备可达，不等于设备页连接状态。诊断不包含精确位置、凭据或设备私密数据。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each step is an independent reachability check; all passes indicate that the device is reachable, which does not equal the device page connection status. Diagnostics do not include precise location, credentials, or private device data."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每一步均为独立可达性检查；全部通过表示设备可达，不等于设备页连接状态。诊断不包含精确位置、凭据或设备私密数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "每次操作只发送一次；没有收到设备确认时不会自动重试。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each operation is sent only once; it will not be automatically retried if device confirmation is not received."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每次操作只发送一次；没有收到设备确认时不会自动重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
